# Normalize line endings across the polyglot, multi-OS fleet (Rust/Python/TS).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
# Canonical CBOR batches are binary (NUL/control bytes); never eol-normalize them,
# so the sha256 pinned in fixtures/PROVENANCE-s3-binance.md survives commit
# deterministically instead of relying on git's content auto-detection (Lot I-a).
*.cbor binary
